Data licence
============

The anonymised renderings in assets/anon/ derive from the IXI dataset
(https://brain-development.org/ixi-dataset/), made available under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode). They are
distributed here, as a derivative work, under the same licence.

Changes made to the IXI scans: the facial regions were anonymised by the
Algernon anonymisation pipeline, and each anonymised volume was rendered as a
3D surface image from three camera angles and two framings.

This repository does not include raw scans, original (non-anonymised)
renderings, or the anonymisation model. The model was trained on ADNI data,
whose Data Use Agreement asks investigators to consider whether publishing
trained weights could allow participant data to be reconstructed; the weights
are therefore not published. To play, each user downloads the original scans
directly from the IXI project, under the IXI terms.

